OL,3,GNEWSAFleetwood's victory was 'best
OL,4,Amoment of my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Fleetwood Town fan has described his
OL,7,Fteam's huge cup upset over Premier
OL,8,FLeague champions Arsenal as the "best
OL,9,Fmoment of my life".
OL,11,FThe Lancashire side, a lowly 18th in
OL,12,FLeague Two, defeated the Gunners on
OL,13,Fpenalties after their EFL Cup fourth
OL,14,Fround tie on Tuesday had ended 1-1.
OL,16,FBen Knapman, who has been supporting
OL,17,Fthe club since he was 10, was attending
OL,18,Fhis 300th match at Highbury Stadium.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
