OL,3,GNEWSAFleetwood's victory was 'best
OL,4,Amoment of my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm over the moon and to see Fleetwood
OL,7,Fbeat a powerhouse of an English team, I
OL,8,Fwould have never dreamed of it," he
OL,9,Fsaid.
